# Line endings are normalized to LF in the repository and on checkout.
#
# Why this file exists: this repository was developed under core.autocrlf=false, and
# many working-tree files carried CRLF while every committed blob was LF. Under that
# setting nothing converts in either direction, so committing one of those files would
# have written its CR bytes INTO the blob — corrupting the store, not just the view.
# Pinning eol here makes the clean filter normalize at commit regardless of any
# contributor's autocrlf setting, and byte-level comparisons of working-tree files
# against committed ones stop failing for reasons that have nothing to do with the
# change under review.
#
# text=auto leaves genuinely binary content alone; it does not force LF into a file
# whose bytes say it is not text.
* text=auto eol=lf
